  "@@_section_settingsSupport": "SETTINGS - SUPPORT  |  lib/features/settings/presentation/settings_about/support_screen.dart",
  "settingsSupport_title": "Support",
  "settingsSupport_scopeTitle": "Before You Write To Us",
  "settingsSupport_helpTitle": "What can we help you with:",
  "settingsSupport_faqCardPrefix": "Most questions are already answered in ",
  "settingsSupport_faqCardSuffix": ".",
  "settingsSupport_scope": "We can help you with the app itself: how a feature works, something that is not behaving as it should, or a backup that will not restore. We cannot see your diary — it stays on your phone — and we cannot check, confirm or look up a hearing date for you.",
